<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>(Tourist rates will differ from those quoted)</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3363/68  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.6222/27  German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.8228/33  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.4098/08  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     33.44/49   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.4702/77  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1573.2/4.7 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     117.79/89  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     7.0700/75  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.4137/07  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.1835/65  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>		     1.4058/68  Singapore Dollars</p>
<p>		     0.7785/90  Australian Dollars</p>
<p>		     7.7365/75  Hong Kong Dollars</p>
<p>One Sterling     US$1.6622/32</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$352.95/353.45</p>
</text>
